# 统一换行符，避免 Windows / Linux 之间来回抖动把 diff 搞花
* text=auto eol=lf

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ 归档区
# archive/ 里的脚本是**历史留档**，必须逐字节保留原样，
# 不许 Git 做任何换行转换 —— 否则 sha256 会和 _PROVENANCE.md 里记的对不上。
archive/** -text

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ 二进制
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xlsm binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.ttf binary
*.ttc binary

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ 锁文件
# uv.lock 是自动生成的，diff 噪音大；具体 diff 用 `git diff -- uv.lock` 强制看
uv.lock text eol=lf
